After more than a decadea of e-mail use and 2 decades of computer use,
I've yet to get infected with a virus. (I'm furiously knocking on my
wooden table top here!) Even WITHOUT anti-virus software. I think it's
simply because no one loves me.  Or maybe because I'm just paranoid? 

With that in mind, I humbly submit the solution is extreme parnoia.  I
suggest all computer users should be exposed to checmical agents that will
cause this parnoia instantly.  It could be slipped into the drinking
water, the NSA should do this to protect American and Canadian
infrastructure.  (The Canadians are very important to the US economy plus
most tech support calls goto Ontario!)  This would also help prevent the
dreaded Chinese hacker attacks.... 


