software packages (e.g. IDL).

until now we used Matrox MI and MII cards. But these only have 4 megs
which is not enough. At home I'm running an Geforce2mx on an x86 with
XFree-4.0.2 which is capable of DirectColor visuals which would be the
preferred one on the alphas. I found some information that it might be
possible to use the pci version of this card on an alpha (id need it for
a 164lx).

Can somebody help me??

TIA
Peter




