> MILO 2.2-17. All drives are SCSI and attached to the onboard
> NCR53c875 and my tape + scanner are attached to a NCR53c810a in a PCI
> slot.

I only have the onbaord NCR53c875.

> Could you send me your .config?

No problem. Here you go with .config-2.4.4.

Cheers,

Ingo

-------

BTW: In the meantime I have compiled and linkes 2.4.5 successfully, but did
not dare boot it yet. Only caveat so far: 2.4.5 will only link with

CONFIG_ALPHA_RUFFIAN=y

but not as GENERIC. Andrea Arcangeli has fixed this already for upcoming
kernels.



