This information applies to the following product(s):

                                    - 1740 series - EISA / ISA SCSI Card(s)
                                    - 2740 series - EISA SCSI Card(s)

... I've used them in testing the RH 7.1 and 7.0 betas on the
AIC-7xxx drivers (it seems that's all I did for a month of
consequence last cycle) -- in EISA HP Netservers -- the LC and
LM family

